## 2. Color Palette

All colors are defined as CSS variables in `app/globals.css`. Use the token names — never hardcode a hex value that isn't in this table.

### Brand Colors

| Token | Hex | Tailwind Utility | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--brand-blue` | `#00193c` | `text-brand-blue` / `bg-brand-blue` | Brand navy — primary dark bg for all dark sections, heroes, header |
| `--brand-orange` / `--primary` | `#d4a53a` | `text-[#d4a53a]` / `bg-[#d4a53a]` | Primary CTA, highlights, icons, underlines, active states |
| `--brand-orange-dark` | `#d4a53a` | `bg-[#d4a53a]` | Hover state of gold buttons |
| `--brand-yellow` / `--accent` | `#d4a53a` | `text-[#d4a53a]` | Active nav links, decorative accents, star ratings |
| `--brand-dark` / `--secondary` | `#383838` | `text-[#383838]` | Dark body text on light backgrounds only — NOT section backgrounds |
| `--brand-light` | `#f5f5f5` | `bg-[#f5f5f5]` | Warm light section backgrounds |

### Semantic / Surface Colors

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--background` | `#f5f5f5` | Default page background |
| `--foreground` | `#383838` | Default body text |
| `--muted` | `#f5f5f5` | Alternating card row backgrounds |
| `--muted-foreground` | `#6b6b6b` | Secondary descriptive text |
| `--border` | `#e5e7eb` | Card borders, dividers, input borders |
| `--card` | `#ffffff` | Card surfaces on light backgrounds |

### Dark Section Background Variants

| Hex / Class | Usage |
|---|---|
| `bg-brand-blue` (`#00193c`) | **All dark sections** — heroes, feature sections, services, why-us, nav, mobile menu |
| `#2a2a2a` | Footer only |
| `#383838` | Body text on light backgrounds, card text — **never** use as section background |

### Opacity Conventions on Dark Backgrounds

| Class | Usage |
|---|---|
| `text-white` | Primary text on dark bg |
| `text-white/80` | Nav links (default) |
| `text-white/70` | Hero body text |
| `text-white/60` | Secondary descriptive text on dark |
| `text-white/50` | Footer body and contact text |
| `text-white/40` | Copyright / legal fine print |
| `text-white/30` | Subtle attribution text |
| `bg-[#f5f5f5]/10` | Ghost surface hover, icon circle bg |
| `bg-[#f5f5f5]/5` | Subtle row hover in dropdowns |
| `border-white/10` | Dividers on dark surfaces |
| `border-white/5` | Very subtle borders in menus |
| `border-white/30` | Ghost button border (default) |

### Gradient Patterns

- **Hero background**: `bg-brand-blue` solid, optionally with radial gold glow overlays at 5–10% opacity
- **Inner page hero overlay**: `linear-gradient(to bottom, #00193c80 0%, #00193c 100%)`
- **Decorative hr**: `linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #d4a53a, transparent)`
- **Card image overlay**: `linear-gradient(to bottom right, transparent 60%, #00193c 100%)`

