## 4. Links & Navigation

### Nav Links (Desktop)

```tsx
className="font-inter text-sm tracking-wide font-medium relative group transition-colors duration-200 text-white/80 hover:text-[#d4a53a]"
// Active:
className="font-inter text-sm tracking-wide font-medium ... text-[#d4a53a]"
```

- Active state: `text-[#d4a53a]` + full-width `h-0.5 bg-[#d4a53a]` underline
- Hover state: text → `#d4a53a`, underline animates from `w-0` to `w-full`
- Underline animation: `transition-all duration-300`

### Mobile Menu

- Background: `bg-brand-blue` — always navy, never gray

### Dropdown Menu Links

```tsx
// Default:
className="text-white/70 hover:text-[#d4a53a] hover:bg-[#f5f5f5]/5"
// Active:
className="text-[#d4a53a] bg-[#f5f5f5]/5"
```

- Container: `bg-[#2a2a2a] border border-white/10 rounded-xl shadow-2xl`
- Padding: `px-5 py-3`
- Separator: `border-b border-white/5`

### Footer Links

```tsx
className="text-white/50 hover:text-[#d4a53a] font-inter text-sm transition-colors duration-200"
```

### Inline Text Links (on light bg)

```tsx
className="text-[#d4a53a] hover:text-[#d4a53a] transition-colors"
```

