## 5. Forms (ADA Compliant)

All form fields must be visually distinct from the page and card background.

### Input / Textarea / Select

```tsx
className="w-full bg-white border border-[#d1d5db] focus:border-[#d4a53a] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#d4a53a]/20 text-[#383838] placeholder:text-[#9ca3af] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm font-inter outline-none transition-all duration-200"
```

### Form Card / Container

```tsx
className="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-[#383838]/8 border border-[#e5e7eb] p-8 lg:p-10"
```

### Labels

```tsx
className="text-[#383838] text-xs font-bold font-inter uppercase tracking-wide"
```

- Required field asterisk: `<span className="text-[#d4a53a]">*</span>`
- Every `<input>`, `<select>`, and `<textarea>` must have a visible `<label>` with matching `htmlFor` / `id`

### Rules

- Never use `bg-[#f5f5f5]` for input backgrounds — use `bg-white` so fields are visually distinct
- Never use a same-color border as the field background (`border-[#f5f5f5]` on `bg-[#f5f5f5]` is invisible)
- Placeholder contrast minimum: `#9ca3af` on white

