## 6. Cards

### Service / Content Card (Light Background)

```tsx
className="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#e8e8e8] bg-white"
```

- Border radius: `rounded-2xl`
- Hover: `hover:border-[#d4a53a] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#d4a53a]/10 hover:-translate-y-1`

### Floating / Overlay Card (Dark Background)

```tsx
className="bg-brand-blue/90 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#d4a53a]/30 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 shadow-xl"
```

### Image Frame Card

```tsx
className="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-[#d4a53a]/30 shadow-2xl shadow-[#d4a53a]/20"
```

### Icon Badge

```tsx
className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#d4a53a]/10 flex items-center justify-center"
// Icon inside:
className="text-[#d4a53a]"  // size={22} strokeWidth={1.75}
```

### Tag / Pill

```tsx
className="inline-block bg-[#d4a53a]/10 text-[#d4a53a] font-inter font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-full"
```

