## 7. Section Layout

### Max Width & Padding

```tsx
className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"
```

Always `max-w-7xl`. Horizontal padding is always `px-6` at all breakpoints.

### Section Vertical Spacing

| Context | Spacing |
|---|---|
| Standard section | `py-24` |
| Hero inner content | `pt-32 pb-20` |
| Inner page hero | `pt-40 pb-20` |
| Footer | `pt-16 pb-8` |

### Section Header Block

```tsx
<div className="text-center mb-16">
  <span className="eyebrow-dash text-[#d4a53a] mb-4">Eyebrow Label</span>
  <h2 className="font-heading text-[#383838] text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight text-balance">
    Section <span className="text-[#d4a53a]">Highlight Word</span>
  </h2>
</div>
```

On dark (`bg-brand-blue`) sections, use `text-white` on the `<h2>` and `text-[#d4a53a]` on the eyebrow.

### Background Alternation

| Surface | Color |
|---|---|
| Light default | `bg-[#f5f5f5]` |
| Light alternate / card | `bg-white` |
| Dark primary (all dark sections) | `bg-brand-blue` |
| Footer | `bg-[#2a2a2a]` |

### Section Dividers (Wave)

Sections that transition between `bg-brand-blue` and `bg-[#f5f5f5]` use SVG wave dividers:

```tsx
{/* Top of a dark section — fill above matches the section above (#f5f5f5 or #fefefe) */}
<svg viewBox="0 0 1440 56" preserveAspectRatio="none" className="w-full block relative z-10" style={{ height: 56 }} aria-hidden="true">
  <path d="M0,0 L1440,0 L1440,22 C720,24 720,24 0,28 Z" fill="#f5f5f5" />
  <path d="M0,28 C720,24 720,24 1440,22 L1440,26 C720,44 720,44 0,48 Z" fill="#d4a53a" />
</svg>

{/* Bottom of a dark section — fill below matches the section below (#f5f5f5) */}
<svg viewBox="0 0 1440 56" preserveAspectRatio="none" className="w-full block relative z-10" style={{ height: 56 }} aria-hidden="true">
  <path d="M0,22 C720,24 720,24 1440,28 L1440,48 C720,44 720,44 0,26 Z" fill="#d4a53a" />
  <path d="M0,26 C720,44 720,44 1440,48 L1440,56 L0,56 Z" fill="#f5f5f5" />
</svg>
```

- Wave band color: `#d4a53a` (gold), tapered thickness left-to-right
- Sections with wave dividers must have `overflow-hidden` removed (use `relative` only)
- Content inside wave-bordered sections needs `relative z-10`

