## 8. Iconography

- Library: `react-icons/ri` (Remix Icons) for UI icons; `lucide-react` for content/service icons
- Icon size on nav/utility: `size={16–18}`
- Icon size in cards: `size={22}` with `strokeWidth={1.75}` (Lucide)
- Icon size in hero badges: `size={14}`
- All icons inherit color from their parent's `text-*` class

---

## 9. Spacing & Border Radius Tokens

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--radius` | `0.5rem` | Base radius |
| `rounded-full` | 9999px | All CTA buttons, tags, pills, badges |
| `rounded-2xl` | 1rem | Cards, image frames |
| `rounded-xl` | 0.75rem | Dropdown menus, floating cards, icon badges, form inputs |
| `rounded-lg` | `--radius-lg` | Secondary containers |

---

## 10. Transitions & Motion

- All interactive elements: `transition-all duration-200` or `transition-colors duration-200`
- Nav underline: `transition-all duration-300`
- Scroll reveal animations: use `tw-animate-css` utility classes only
- Hover scale on primary buttons: `hover:scale-105`
- Active press on primary buttons: `active:scale-95`
- Dropdown arrow rotation: `transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:rotate-180`
- No animation libraries beyond `tw-animate-css` should be introduced

---

## 11. Dark Mode

This project does **not** implement a user-toggled dark mode. All dark surfaces are intentional design choices using the brand dark palette. The `.dark` variant in `styles/globals.css` is a legacy scaffold and is **not used**. Do not add `dark:` variants to new components.
